ock_id":"9w9i"}]},{"client_msg_id":"51dee0b6-ffec-4c92-9bf3-26447abd7435","type":"message","user":"UERCTTT8B","text":"カスタムシェーダーを削除した直後に新しく作ると番号が再利用されてバグるという極めてエッジケースなバグを発見","ts":"1628954152.125700","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"aMXXs"}]},{"client_msg_id":"c873a171-3d2e-4a95-ba6f-02a38f75ae37","type":"message","user":"UKHUVMBJR","text":"golang/freetypeはライセンス問題で開発中止になったらしいけど、いうてFTLはライセンス表記一文足せば使えるものなので、\n自分用にforkして整えてみようかなの気持ち","ts":"1628954097.125100","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"t=qn"}]},{"client_msg_id":"68866ef2-9905-41a7-bd14-b4e13f3a3c61","type":"message","user":"U022PB40WAF","text":"どっちなんだろ…GPUメモリ内で完結するもんだったかな……。","ts":"1628953962.124400","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"gKQ4"}]},{"client_msg_id":"36d06c66-ede9-4c2e-a0c7-c69089bd23ee","type":"message","user":"UERCTTT8B","text":"GPU と CPU が離れちゃっているので、 GPU の中でメモリ確保から全部完結させるもんだと思ってました","ts":"1628953643.121600","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"2wNnM"}]},{"client_msg_id":"04b6a4b9-11d7-4274-ae5e-ba3d921c5b50","type":"message","user":"U022PB40WAF","text":"ヒープメモリにバッファ確保して描画させてから直接DMAで送りつける方式は古かったかな…。","ts":"1628953565.120800","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"ZO6vz"}]},{"client_msg_id":"9a75e344-3d26-476f-ae49-d9d36096bca5","type":"message","user":"U022PB40WAF","text":"だいぶ昔の記憶なのでどうも曖昧になってる…レンダリングキューだったかなその方式。","ts":"1628953292.119300","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"B+5"}]},{"client_msg_id":"6c2539b1-8f8b-455c-8b6b-f6feb46827da","type":"message","user":"UERCTTT8B","text":"うひょーバグ直った (テストが前提をぶっ壊すようなことをしていただけだった)","ts":"1628953249.118600","team":"T03C4RC8V","re